<urn:usf:product-scope-disposition:current> <urn:usf:predicate:dispositionMeaning> "Required by the profile now. The product claims it, and its satisfaction condition is answerable from current evidence." <urn:usf:graph:product-profile-vocabulary> .
<urn:usf:product-scope-disposition:current> <urn:usf:predicate:type> <urn:usf:type:ProductScopeDisposition> <urn:usf:graph:product-profile-vocabulary> .
