<urn:usf:product-scope-disposition:experimental> <urn:usf:predicate:dispositionMeaning> "Present in some form but not yet a claim. Evidence exists and is insufficient to make it required." <urn:usf:graph:product-profile-vocabulary> .
<urn:usf:product-scope-disposition:experimental> <urn:usf:predicate:type> <urn:usf:type:ProductScopeDisposition> <urn:usf:graph:product-profile-vocabulary> .
