<urn:usf:product-scope-disposition:not-claimed> <urn:usf:predicate:dispositionMeaning> "Explicitly excluded from the profile claim. Naming it prevents an aspiration being read as delivery." <urn:usf:graph:product-profile-vocabulary> .
<urn:usf:product-scope-disposition:not-claimed> <urn:usf:predicate:type> <urn:usf:type:ProductScopeDisposition> <urn:usf:graph:product-profile-vocabulary> .
