<urn:usf:product-scope-disposition:planned> <urn:usf:predicate:dispositionMeaning> "Intended for this profile and not yet realised. It is a commitment, not a claim of delivery." <urn:usf:graph:product-profile-vocabulary> .
<urn:usf:product-scope-disposition:planned> <urn:usf:predicate:type> <urn:usf:type:ProductScopeDisposition> <urn:usf:graph:product-profile-vocabulary> .
