<urn:usf:product-scope-disposition:reserved> <urn:usf:predicate:dispositionMeaning> "The profile reserves the concept so a later revision can claim it without renaming. Nothing is promised." <urn:usf:graph:product-profile-vocabulary> .
<urn:usf:product-scope-disposition:reserved> <urn:usf:predicate:type> <urn:usf:type:ProductScopeDisposition> <urn:usf:graph:product-profile-vocabulary> .
